<title>USA: Ocean Energy Inc Q2 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Ocean Energy Inc Q2 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>BATON ROUGE, La. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					 Second Quarter     First Half</p>
<p>					  1997    1996     1997    1996</p>
<p> Operating revenues	    $65,592 $32,253 $130,069 $69,082</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p>  Lease operating expenses    14,503   8,076   27,213  16,522</p>
<p>  Severance taxes		  2,706   2,636    5,378   5,522</p>
<p>Depreciation, depletion,</p>
<p>   and amortization	     28,684  14,623   51,580  28,973</p>
<p>General and administrative</p>
<p>   expense			   4,241   2,767    8,596   6,025</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses  50,134  28,102   92,767  57,042</p>
<p> Operating income		 15,458   4,151   37,302  12,040</p>
<p>    Total other expenses	 6,666   3,420   12,620   8,190</p>
<p>Net income before income taxes</p>
<p>					 8,792     731   24,682   3,850</p>
<p> Income tax expense		2,596     296    8,555   1,514</p>
<p> Net income			  6,196     435   16,127   2,336</p>
<p> Earnings per share primary     0.30    0.02     0.77    0.13</p>
<p> Shares outstanding primary   20,900  20,466   20,895  18,333</p>
<p> Shares outstanding diluted   20,909  20,655   20,898  18,673</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
